# Hearthstone Deck Tracker on Linux (Steam + Proton) — LLM Reference

**Verified 2026-08-31** on: Linux Mint 22.3 Cinnamon (X11), native Steam,
`Proton - Experimental` build `1787725910` (`experimental-11.0-20260826`),
winetricks `20240105`, HDT v1.57.4, NVIDIA proprietary driver.

Version numbers age; the failure modes and fixes below should not. The procedure
is written to be distro-agnostic — only the package-install command in Section 1
differs between distributions.

**Starting point assumed:** Battle.net installed and working via Steam + Proton,
and Hearthstone installed through Battle.net. Nothing else. If the user has not
got that far, that is a separate problem — see 1.4.

**Windows needed?** Not for installing, running, or updating HDT. Needed once,
only for HSReplay.net login (Section 6). Users who don't need HSReplay can skip
that entirely.

Companion guide: https://github.com/Bakedpotato-99/Hearthstone-Deck-Tracker-linux-proton-install

