## 9. Untested environments

Distributions other than Linux Mint 22.3 (the procedure is written to be portable,
but only Mint is verified) · Wayland (X11 tooling doesn't apply; overlay behaviour
under XWayland unknown) · desktop environments other than Cinnamon (overlay click
behaviour is known to vary — KDE, XFCE and tiling WMs all differ) · Flatpak Steam
(extra sandbox layer could compound the portal issue in Section 6) · non-NVIDIA
GPUs · fresh Steam prefixes with respect to 8.2 · HDT versions past v1.57.4.

